/*
 * Implements semantic validation for field access on async values in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported fields:
 *   - run  — method-like field returning a delegate driving the async to completion
 *   - poll — method-like field returning a delegate resuming the async once
 *
 * This module is invoked by FieldValidation when the left operand is an AsyncType.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::fields::async_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/fields/async_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-10-23
